.TH ISO2CHD\-GUI 1 "September 2026" "2.0.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
iso2chd\-gui \- Graphical companion frontend for the iso2chd batch conversion suite
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B iso2chd-gui
[\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B iso2chd-gui
is a PyQt6-powered graphical user interface frontend designed for the
.B iso2chd
batch disk image conversion utility. It simplifies queueing multiple .iso, .bin/.cue, or directory targets, customizing conversion threads, managing codecs, switching dynamic color themes (including a Custom Color Wheel Studio), inspecting CHD headers, and tracking real-time storage savings.
.SH FEATURES
.TP
\fBMulti-file Queue & Drag-and-Drop\fR
Drag and drop individual files or complete directory hierarchies straight into the batch queue window.
.TP
\fBDynamic Theme Engine\fR
Switch between curated color themes (Nord Dark, Dracula, Matrix Green, Catppuccin Mocha, Solarized Dark, Cyberpunk Neon) or build a custom palette with the built-in Color Studio.
.TP
\fBPerformance & Codec Tuning\fR
Easily adjust multi-threading preferences, change conversion modes (Auto, CD, DVD), select compression codecs (ZLIB, LZMA), and verify integrity hashes on the fly.
.TP
\fBReal-time Progress & Telemetry\fR
Monitor active conversions with live percentage updates, scrollable execution logs, and an overall storage savings calculator.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show Python/Qt command line help options and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR iso2chd (1),
.BR chdman (1)
